        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bernard Coard, Maurice Bishop, Hudson Austin\n- Organizations: New Jewel Movement, Military Council\n- Places: Grenada\n- Concepts: socio-economic development, education, black liberation\n\nFacts:\n- Maurice Bishop was a democratic politician in Grenada and the leader of the New Jewel Movement.\n- The New Jewel Movement was an effort focused on socio-economic development, education, and black liberation.\n- Maurice Bishop was killed.\n- After Maurice Bishop was killed, Hudson Austin deposed Bernard Coard in Grenada.\n- After deposing Bernard Coard, Hudson Austin formed a military government called the Military Council and ruled Grenada as its chairman.",
